{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8afc32a8-c532-480d-8261-8fe0fcba2d75",
    "name": "Peach Payments Authentication Payment Links API",
    "description": "Payment orchestration APIs for Peach Payments, a pan-African payment gateway (South Africa, Kenya, Mauritius). Covers OAuth authentication, Checkout (Hosted / Embedded / Embedded Express), the Payments API for server-to-server debits and refunds, Payment Links, Payouts, and Reconciliation. Card processing is PCI DSS Level 1 certified. Auth is OAuth 2.0 client-credentials (clientId + clientSecret + merchantId -> Bearer access_token) for Checkout / Payouts / Reconciliation, and an inline authentication object (userId + password + entityId) for the server-to-server Payments API.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Peach Payments Developer Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-07-28T02:34:44.000Z",
